# 20 — Slides & Notes

Applies when creating/editing presentations or guided notes.

- **Notes-first:** design Guided Notes before the slideshow.
- Obey `docs/standards/SLIDESHOW_STANDARD.md`, `docs/standards/SLIDESHOW_LOGIC_LOCKDOWN.md`, `docs/standards/GUIDED_NOTES_STANDARD.md`.
- BQ/V/N anchors on slides must mirror student notes exactly.
- No hidden required note answers on unrelated slides.
- Slides may be richer than notes but stay extremely easy to follow; premium visual quality.
